                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "05509cf8-0c3c-41b1-8e12-6d8eb2efab0e",
                                "sense_id": "b5f81882-ecc7-3414-a86c-12918759bbf0",
                                "text": "It boils down to science. Biology, chemistry and physics. I used to hate bio and chem. Now they fascinate me because I’ve realised they make up the world around us as well as us.",
